{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 64,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.6100463867188,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "regimens for evaluation in stage 2, based on 8-week safety and efficacy endpoints. Investigational arms",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.950489044189453,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        524.318115234375,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "that did not meet predefined safety and efficacy criteria were not considered for further evaluation.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        102.29462432861328,
        527.4442138671875,
        116.73762512207031
      ],
      "text": "The second stage of the study was equivalent to a Phase 3 trial investigating the safety and efficacy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.49463653564453,
        527.44873046875,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "of the most promising regimen. As intended in the study protocol, the regimen was evaluated for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        527.4431762695312,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "safety and efficacy in comparison with the SoC arm at 72 weeks after randomization. Stage 2 of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.13818359375,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "trial included an intervention arm of BPaLM compared with the locally approved SoC, consistent with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996048927307129,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.4133911132812,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "WHO recommendations for the treatment of MDR/RR-TB or pre-XDR-TB at the time of trial conduct",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        527.3740234375,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "(including a 9–12-month injectable-containing regimen; 18–24-month WHO-recommended regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.973618507385254,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        527.4024658203125,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "[pre-2019]; 9–12-month all-oral regimen; and 18–20-month all-oral regimen). The TB-PRACTECAL",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69471740722656,
        527.209716796875,
        209.13771057128906
      ],
      "text": "trial stopped enrolling patients soon after its independent data safety and monitoring board indicated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97467041015625,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.5596923828125,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "that the BPaLM regimen is superior to the SoC, because it was considered that more data were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.4418334960938,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "extremely unlikely to change the results of the trial. This trial was not designed to compare the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        273.435546875,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "investigational regimens against each other.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.9987335205078,
        527.3969116210938,
        270.4417419433594
      ],
      "text": "Eligible patients were aged 15 years and older, and had bacteriologically (molecular or phenotypic)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.1986083984375,
        527.4498291015625,
        283.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "confirmed TB and resistance to at least rifampicin by a molecular or phenotypic drug susceptibility",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.39862060546875,
        527.4244384765625,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "test. The primary efficacy outcome was the composite endpoint of unfavourable outcomes (failure,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.5986328125,
        527.48046875,
        310.0416564941406
      ],
      "text": "death, treatment discontinuation, recurrence or LTFU) at 72 weeks after randomization. Relevant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.798583984375,
        527.5313110351562,
        323.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "secondary efficacy outcomes included culture conversion at 12 and 24 weeks, unfavourable outcomes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.964141845703125,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.99859619140625,
        527.4287719726562,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "at 24 weeks after randomization, unfavourable outcomes at 108 weeks after randomization, median",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.4344482421875,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "time to culture conversion and recurrence by week 48 in the investigational arms. Participants were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.39862060546875,
        515.119873046875,
        362.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "randomized in a 1:1:1:1 ratio into either the SoC or one of the following three intervention arms:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        370.10260009765625,
        78.23609924316406,
        384.5456237792969
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        370.10260009765625,
        282.5578918457031,
        384.5456237792969
      ],
      "text": "Arm 1: 24 weeks of B-Pa-Lzd-Mfx (BPaLM);",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        383.3025207519531,
        78.23609924316406,
        397.74554443359375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        383.3025207519531,
        298.18011474609375,
        397.74554443359375
      ],
      "text": "Arm 2: 24 weeks of B-Pa-Lzd-Cfz (BPaLC); and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        396.5025939941406,
        78.23609924316406,
        410.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        396.5025939941406,
        252.0450439453125,
        410.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "Arm 3: 24 weeks of B-Pa-Lzd (BPaL).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        418.2065124511719,
        527.3961181640625,
        432.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "In all intervention arms, linezolid was given at 600 mg daily for 16 weeks then 300 mg daily for the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        431.406494140625,
        527.4365234375,
        445.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "remaining 8 weeks (or earlier when moderately tolerated). Bedaquiline was given at 400 mg once",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        444.60650634765625,
        527.4420166015625,
        459.0495300292969
      ],
      "text": "daily for 2 weeks followed by 200 mg three times per week for 22 weeks. Safety monitoring for most",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        457.8065185546875,
        527.5572509765625,
        472.2495422363281
      ],
      "text": "participants included multiple electrocardiograms (ECGs) at baseline, then weekly until week 8, every",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999149322509766,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.0065002441406,
        527.1879272460938,
        485.44952392578125
      ],
      "text": "4 weeks up to week 24 and then every 8 weeks thereafter. Microbiological monitoring included",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.2065124511719,
        527.3707275390625,
        498.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "smear microscopy and culture at baseline and day 7, then every 4 weeks up until week 24 and every",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        497.406494140625,
        159.21920776367188,
        511.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "8 weeks thereafter.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        522.2178344726562,
        99.98310852050781,
        536.5728149414062
      ],
      "text": "ZeNix",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        544.03173828125,
        527.4036254882812,
        558.4747314453125
      ],
      "text": "ZeNix was a Phase 3 partially blinded, randomized trial assessing the safety and efficacy of various",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        557.231689453125,
        527.6248168945312,
        571.6746826171875
      ],
      "text": "doses and treatment durations of linezolid plus bedaquiline and pretomanid in individuals with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        570.4317016601562,
        527.4300537109375,
        584.8746948242188
      ],
      "text": "pulmonary MDR/RR-TB and additional resistance to fluoroquinolones (with or without resistance to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        583.6317138671875,
        527.4156494140625,
        598.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "injectable agents) or those with treatment intolerant or nonresponsive MDR/RR-TB. Eligible patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        596.8317260742188,
        527.0965576171875,
        611.2747192382812
      ],
      "text": "were aged 14 years and older, weighed at least 35 kg, had a documented HIV result and had",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        610.03173828125,
        527.1764526367188,
        624.4747314453125
      ],
      "text": "bacteriologically confirmed sputum culture positive XDR-TB (pre-2021 definition) or bacteriologically",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99479866027832,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        623.231689453125,
        527.5145263671875,
        637.6746826171875
      ],
      "text": "confirmed MDR/RR-TB, but were treatment intolerant or nonresponsive to previous MDR/RR-TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        636.4317016601562,
        527.5531616210938,
        650.8746948242188
      ],
      "text": "treatment. The primary study outcome was the incidence of bacteriological failure or relapse or clinical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.964994430541992,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        649.6317138671875,
        527.1341552734375,
        664.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "failure through follow-up until 26 weeks after the end of treatment. The secondary outcomes included",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.968855857849121,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        662.8317260742188,
        527.4400634765625,
        677.2747192382812
      ],
      "text": "incidence of bacteriological failure or relapse or clinical failure through follow-up until 78 weeks after",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        676.03173828125,
        527.4078979492188,
        690.4747314453125
      ],
      "text": "the end of treatment. Participants received 26 weeks of treatment with BPaL. Each of the four arms",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.231689453125,
        527.4081420898438,
        703.6746826171875
      ],
      "text": "varied the dose and duration of linezolid: 1200 mg 26 weeks, 1200 mg 9 weeks, 600 mg 26 weeks or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        702.4317016601562,
        527.126953125,
        716.8746948242188
      ],
      "text": "600 mg 9 weeks. Bedaquiline was given at 200 mg once daily for 8 weeks then 100 mg once daily for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995949745178223,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        715.6317138671875,
        527.2098388671875,
        730.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "18 weeks. This off-label dosing schedule is supported by pharmacokinetic simulations for an alternative",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.95480728149414,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        728.8317260742188,
        527.395751953125,
        743.2747192382812
      ],
      "text": "bedaquiline dosing schedule that provides comparable exposures and was developed to support",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        740.7557373046875,
        527.4215698242188,
        756.4747314453125
      ],
      "text": "(31) adherence and facilitate treatment administration (all medicines daily throughout the regimen)  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        755.231689453125,
        527.43994140625,
        769.6746826171875
      ],
      "text": "Safety monitoring included scheduled testing and assessments of laboratory parameters, ECG, vital",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23320007324219,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "50 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
